 45-minute visit, or a longer Head Spa for more massage and scalp-care time.</p></details><details><summary>Will my hair be dry when I leave?</summary><p>No. Hair is left wet. Professional drying or styling must be booked separately, so arrange it in advance if you want that service.</p></details><details><summary>Can I book with short hair, thinning hair or extensions?</summary><p>Your provider can discuss scalp care for your hair needs. Contact Matrix first if you have extensions, braids, very short or thinning hair, recent chemical services or scalp concerns so the suitable approach can be confirmed.</p></details><details><summary>Does Head Spa treat hair loss or scalp disease?</summary><p>No. Matrix Head Spa services focus on cosmetic scalp care and relaxation. New hair loss, painful or inflamed areas and persistent scalp symptoms should be evaluated by an appropriate healthcare professional.</p></details><details><summary>Can I add a facial to my Head Spa?</summary><p>Yes. Choose Matrix Head Spa + Hydrating Glow Facial for a 120-minute combination at $285. The booking menu also offers men\u2019s Head Spa combinations with a mini facial or a custom facial.</p></details><details><summary>How often should I book?</summary><p>Choose a schedule around your preferences, scalp comfort and the experience you enjoy. Your provider can discuss a suitable return visit; a fixed weekly schedule is not required.</p></details><details><summary>Where can I book a Head Spa near Union Grove, Twin Lakes or Antioch?</summary><p>Visit Matrix Massage &amp; Bodywork at 24804 75th St, Salem, WI 53168. Our Salem studio serves Salem Lakes, Paddock Lake, Union Grove, Twin Lakes, Trevor, Bristol and nearby Antioch, Illinois. All appointments are at this Salem location. Book online or text 262-939-9325.</p></details></div></div></section><section class=\"section paper\"><div class=\"inner center\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">NEARBY, IN SALEM</p><h2>Your next quiet moment is close.</h2><div class=\